  "knowledge": {
    "purpose": "See how setup works and what living with it looks like: four steps in order, the same room in the morning, at dusk and at night, then what the hub keeps doing on its own.",
    "laws": [
      "Steps are numbered because setup really has an order",
      "One room drawn three times shows a scene is a change over the day; each picture sits beside its words",
      "The feature grid closes on three equal cards, each icon meaning something",
      "The pill nav is the same capsule as on every page; the page in view is lit"
    ],
